<title>RUSSIA: Duma urges limits on foreign financial services.</title>
<headline>Duma urges limits on foreign financial services.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's State Duma lower house of parliament called on Friday for limits on foreign investment in operations with securities and depositaries, investment funds, and banking, insurance and other financial services, including auditing.</p>
<p>The Duma passed amendments, calling for limits in these areas, in a first reading, to the law on foreign investment.  </p>
<p>The Duma also called for outright bans on foreign investment in many infrastructure sectors of the economy for national security reasons.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
